msgstr ""
"知道你可以拿起文字分割和 `String`的值会使我们在`first_word`上再有一个改进，并"
"且它的签名："

#: src/ch04-03-slices.md:386
msgid ""
"A more experienced Rustacean would write the signature shown in Listing 4-9 "
"instead because it allows us to use the same function on both `&String` "
"values and `&str` values."
msgstr ""
"一个经验丰富的Rustacean会写上列表4-9中显示的签名，因为它允许我们同时使用同一"
"个函数在 `&String` 和 `&str` 两个值。"

